; Messages for the direct uninstaller: the persistent managed-storage desktop
; shortcut and the Microsoft Store edition coexistence warnings. Keep
; placeholders aligned across every installer locale.

english.ManagedStorageShortcutPrompt=To make these files easy to find after uninstalling, create a "magnetic-desk Files" shortcut on the desktop?%n%nThe shortcut opens:%n%1
english.ManagedStorageShortcutCreateFailed=The desktop shortcut could not be created. Your files are still safe at:%n%1
english.StoreEditionDataPreserved=The Microsoft Store edition of magnetic-desk is still installed. Its data lives in a separate location and will not be touched by this uninstall; the desktop-edition data is also kept for safety.
english.StoreEditionStateUnknown=Unable to verify whether the Microsoft Store edition of magnetic-desk is installed. For safety, app data has been kept.%n%nPlease uninstall the Store edition first and retry, or choose to keep the data.
chinesesimplified.ManagedStorageShortcutPrompt=为避免卸载后找不到这些文件，是否在桌面创建“magnetic-desk Files”快捷方式？%n%n快捷方式将打开：%n%1
chinesesimplified.ManagedStorageShortcutCreateFailed=未能创建桌面快捷方式。你的文件仍安全保存在：%n%1
chinesesimplified.StoreEditionDataPreserved=检测到 Microsoft Store 版 magnetic-desk 仍在安装。它的数据保存在独立位置，本次卸载不会清除；直装版数据也将一并保留以确保安全。
chinesesimplified.StoreEditionStateUnknown=无法确认 Microsoft Store 版 magnetic-desk 的安装状态，为安全起见已保留应用数据。%n%n请先卸载商店版后重试，或选择保留数据继续。

